v class=\"wrap hero-in\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">Nail salon · Trancas St, Napa</p>\n    <h1>Napa Valley Nails Salon</h1>\n    <p class=\"tagline\">Manicure, pedicure, gel, dip at acrylic sa Trancas Street, mula sa magiliw na team na pinagkakatiwalaan ng mga suki sa loob ng maraming taon.</p>\n    <div class=\"hero-meta\"><a class=\"rating-badge\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Napa+Valley+Nails+Salon/@38.3247587,-122.2902883,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x808506c02f40e403:0x46543d5ba4fd4849!8m2!3d38.3247587!4d-122.2902883!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span>4.8 · 69 review sa Google<span class=\"ext\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><span class=\"open-badge\" id=\"openBadge\" hidden></span></div>\n    <div class=\"cta-row\">\n      <a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\" href=\"tel:+17072524551\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.6 10.8a15.1 15.1 0 0 0 6.6 6.6l2.2-2.2c.3-.3.7-.4 1-.2 1.1.4 2.3.6 3.6.6.6 0 1 .4 1 1V20c0 .6-.4 1-1 1A17 17 0 0 1 3 4c0-.6.4-1 1-1h3.5c.6 0 1 .4 1 1 0 1.3.2 2.5.6 3.6.1.3 0 .7-.2 1l-2.3 2.2z\"/></svg> Tumawag para mag-book</a>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=Napa%20Valley%20Nails%20Salon%2C%20706%20Trancas%20St%2C%20Ste%20A%2C%20Napa%2C%20CA%2094558\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a7 7 0 0 0-7 7c0 5.2 7 13 7 13s7-7.8 7-13a7 7 0 0 0-7-7zm0 9.5A2.5 2.5 0 1 1 12 6.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0 5z\"/></svg> Direksyon</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"stripe\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"highlights\"><div class=\"wrap\"><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Napa+Valley+Nails+Salon/@38.3247587,-122.2902883,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x808506c02f40e403:0x46543d5ba4fd4849!8m2!3d38.3247587!4d-122.2902883!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">4.8★ mula sa 69 review</a></li><li>Welcome ang walk-in</li><li>Manicure at pedicure</li><li>Gel, dip at acrylic</li><li>Nail art</li><li>Tumatanggap ng credit card</li><li>Pribadong parking lot</li></ul></div></div>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"about\"><div class=\"wrap about-grid\"><div><p class=\"kicker\">Ang salon</p><h2>Malinis, magiliw at nakaka-relax.</h2><p>Ang Napa Valley Nails Salon ay full-service na nail salon sa 706 Trancas Street sa Napa. Gumagawa kami ng manicure, pedicure, gel, dip powder, acrylic, extension at nail art para sa babae at lalaki.</p><p>Malinis at hygienic ang salon namin, napakaraming kulay na mapagpipilian, at bumabalik-balik ang aming mga suki para sa nakaka-relax na pedicure, foot massage at manipis na acrylic na mukhang natural. Kasama sa aming mga tech sina Ann, Lee, Joe, Kenny, Kevin at Kim.</p><div class=\"facts\"><a class=\"fact\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Napa+Valley+Nails+Salon/@38.3247587,-122.2902883,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x808506c02f40e403:0x46543d5ba4fd4849!8m2!3d38.3247587!4d-122.2902883!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>4.8★</b><span>69 review</span></a><div class=\"fact\"><b>Nextdoor</b><span>Paborito ng kapitbahayan</span></div><div class=\"fact\"><b>6 na araw</b><span>Bukas Lun–Sab</span></div></div></div><div class=\"about-img\"><img src=\"images/red-manicure.jpg\" alt=\"Bagong pulang manicure\" loading=\"lazy\"></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"services\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Menu</p><h2>Mga serbisyo</h2></div><div class=\"services\"><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">01</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Manicure</h3></div><p>Klasikong manicure, at manicure para sa lalaki.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">02</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Pedicure</h3></div><p>Nakaka-relax na pedicure at foot massage. May pedicure din para sa lalaki.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">03</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Manicure at pedicure</h3></div><p>Pareho sa isang bisita.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">04</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Gel nails</h3></div></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">05</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Dip powder nails</h3></div></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">06</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Acrylic nails</h3></div><p>Manipis at natural na tingnang acrylic na ayon sa mga kapitbahay ay tumatagal ng 3–4 na linggo nang hindi umaangat.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">07</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Gel nail extension at nail extension</h3></div></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">08</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Nail art</h3></div></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">09</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Nail polish</h3></div><p>Napakaraming kulay na mapagpipilian.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">10</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Waxing</h3></div></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">11</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Skin care</h3></div></article></div><p class=\"note\">Hindi namin ipinapaskil online ang presyo. Tumawag sa (707) 252-4551 para sa kasalukuyang presyo.</p></div></section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"amenities\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Mabuting malaman</p><h2>Dapat malaman</h2></div><ul class=\"amenities\"><li><b>Welcome ang walk-in</b><span>Mas mabuting tumawag muna kung gusto mo ng partikular na tech</span></li><li><b>Tumatanggap ng credit card</b></li><li><b>Pribadong parking lot</b></li><li><b>Paradahan ng bisikleta</b></li><li><b>Gender-neutral na banyo</b></li><li><b>Serbisyo para sa lalaki</b><span>Manicure at pedicure para sa lalaki</span></li></ul></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"gallery\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Gallery</p><h2>Mga bagong gawa</h2></div><div class=\"gallery\"><figure><img src=\"images/gel-colors.jpg\" alt=\"Multicolor na gel manicure\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/red-nail-art.jpg\" alt=\"Pulang nail art\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/silver-glitter.jpg\" alt=\"Silver glitter na kuko\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/classic-red.jpg\" alt=\"Klasikong pulang manicure\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/lace-nails.jpg\" alt=\"Mahahabang puting kuko\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/lilac-gel.jpg\" alt=\"Lilac na gel nails\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/natural-nude.jpg\" alt=\"Natural nude na manicure\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/lavender-nails.jpg\" alt=\"Lavender na manicure\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"press\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Pagkilala</p><h2>Paborito ng kapitbahayan</h2></div><div class=\"press\"><figure class=\"press-item\"><blockquote>“NAPA Valley Nails is a Neighborhood Favorite in 1 neighborhood. It also won in 2020, 2022 and 2023.”</blockquote><figcaption><b>Nextdoor Fave Awards</b> · Nextdoor Neighborhood Favorite · <a href=\"https://nextdoor.com/pages/napa-valley-nails-napa-ca/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Read</a></figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"reviews\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Mga review</p><h2>Sabi ng aming mga customer</h2></div><div class=\"ratings\"><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">4.8</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Google</b> · 69 review</div><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Napa+Valley+Nails+Salon/@38.3247587,-122.2902883,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x808506c02f40e403:0x46543d5ba4fd4849!8m2!3d38.3247587!4d-122.2902883!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Magbasa pa ng mga review sa Google →</a></div></div></div><div class=\"reviews\"><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Love 💕 this nail salon. The team does a great job (just what I ask for) and are welcoming and can almost always fit me in at the last minute. Thank you Ann for years of service and friendship.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Napa%20Valley%20Nails%20Salon%20706%20Trancas%20St%20Napa%20CA%2094558\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Nov 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“The nail salon employees here are very nice, and take good care of your nails. They give great massages and are hygienic.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Napa%20Valley%20Nails%20Salon%20706%20Trancas%20St%20Napa%20CA%2094558\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Aug 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“My wife and I both got a nice relaxing pedicure on vacation! I mean, when she uses that buffer kind of roughly, I&#39;m crawling up the back of the chair... But my feet feel so nice now! The foot massage was wonderful. Thank you!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Napa%20Valley%20Nails%20Salon%20706%20Trancas%20St%20Napa%20CA%2094558\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Dec 2024</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Lee did an exceptional service, my feet are so clean, relaxed and painted! I’m so excited they look great! I’m falling asleep being so comfortable and relaxed I couldn’t help it!! I’m coming back for more !!!”</blockquote><figcaption>— BestProsInTown reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.bestprosintown.com/ca/napa/napa-valley-nails-salon-/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BestProsInTown</a> · Jul 2024</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“They did a wonderful job, charge very reasonably, and do a great acrylics.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Napa%20Valley%20Nails%20Salon%20706%20Trancas%20St%20Napa%20CA%2094558\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Jun 2024</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Ann did my pedicure and my manicure! Not only did she do such a stunning job, she was so sweet and kind. I really enjoyed our time together and our little chats :) she’s an absolute doll and truly made my nail appointment an experience. Please please please go here and ask for her if she’s in! Calling ahead is a good idea to make sure she can take you. Thank you, Ann!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Napa%20Valley%20Nails%20Salon%20706%20Trancas%20St%20Napa%20CA%2094558\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Mar 2023</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“I have finally made Napa Valley Nails my place !! My experience has always been pleasurable. Anna is so sweet and does an amazing and detailed job.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Napa%20Valley%20Nails%20Salon%20706%20Trancas%20St%20Napa%20CA%2094558\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Dec 2019</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“I just went to this shop yesterday and will definitely be coming back! This place is so clean and carries a huge variety of colors to choose from. My nail tech Anna did an amazing job. She was very kind and pleasant to me. I absolutely love it here and will come back very soon.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Napa%20Valley%20Nails%20Salon%20706%20Trancas%20St%20Napa%20CA%2094558\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Jun 2019</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"faq\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">FAQ</p><h2>Mga tanong, sinagot</h2></div><div class=\"faq\"><details><summary>Kailangan ko ba ng appointment?</summary><p>Welcome ang walk-in, at halos lagi ka naming maisisingit kahit biglaan. Kung gusto mo ng partikular na tech, tumawag muna sa (707) 252-4551.</p></details><details><summary>Anong mga serbisyo ang meron kayo?</summary><p>Manicure, pedicure, gel nails, dip powder, acrylic, gel at regular na nail extension, nail art at polish, pati manicure at pedicure para sa lalaki. Nakalista rin ang waxing at skin care.</p></details><details><summary>Anong oras kayo bukas?</summary><p>Bukas kami Lunes–Biyernes 9:30 AM–6:30 PM at Sabado 9:30 AM–6 PM. Sarado tuwing Linggo.</p></details><details><summary>Saan kayo matatagpuan?</summary><p>Nasa 706 Trancas St, Suite A, Napa, CA 94558 kami, may pribadong parking lot.</p></details><details><summary>Tumatanggap ba kayo ng credit card?</summary><p>Oo, tumatanggap kami ng credit card.</p></details><details><summary>Magkano ang mga serbisyo?</summary><p>Hindi namin ipinapaskil online ang presyo, pero napaka-makatwiran nito. Tawagan kami sa (707) 252-4551 para sa kasalukuyang presyo.</p></details></div></div></se